    <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.82rem; margin-top:10px;">Note: with all 6 winners tied at 1-0, seed 6 onward is set by points scored, not record &mdash; see the <a href="season.html?year=2026">2026 season page</a> for the full breakdown.</p>
